1790141080221710	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyxxI		item.comment	bn-36x3b	{"body":"Recursive defs landed in ws bn-36x3b (728f494, synced onto fdf2373). Rule: a Nat/Int param k decreases as k - c (c>=1) at every self-call, under if-guards comparing k with constants that bound k below by c (docs/11 §8; RFC 0003 states no rule). Refusals typed: NoDecreasingMeasure, MutualRecursion, RecursionBoundNotConstant, MeasureOutOfDomain. Calls unfold at the constant measure: chain <= MAX_RECURSION_DEPTH=64 checked from the constant, then an iterative plan pre-charges exact size/depth/work, nesting <= MAX_UNFOLD_NESTING=512, fresh binders per unfolding. TransitiveClosure fixture elaborates (golden), lowering refused NonIntegerState. Tests: tests/recursion.rs (14: rule + mutants, set-level closure vs bounded reachability + mutant, Floyd-Warshall lowered vs Warshall over 64 relations via reference engine, metamorphic identity, capture), 6 new resource_bounds tests. Review record tools/governance/reviews/bn-36x3b.toml without security_review. just check: all green except governance security-review-present (lead-owned); dossier, lean, test-policy pass."}	blake3:_BlRBzy75xxaBmkbNCYxiQ7k3LEXHDMLTR_irkT0Rkk
