1790142033582208	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy0RI		item.comment	bn-3m1d	{"body":"Committed 8bc662a in WS. Time bound: Sleep op (time::sleep_until on the Cx's virtual timer driver; no-driver refused), Advance op (LabRuntime::advance_time); journal Scheduled/Fired/Cancelled from the Sleep future's own trace events and Advanced from the lab clock; advance batches canonical by (deadline, timer ordinal); timer cancels after ack. Lift: parallel checked clock model (from zero, monotone, fire at/after deadline, none late, none outliving its task, cancel only under region cancellation). Tests: tests/pr14_impl05_virtual_time.rs, 10 tests, 30,310 logs incl. sibling regions and timer ties, 7 seeds with fire- and close-order anti-vacuity, scripted differential, 15 projection subsets, 7 mutation operators, typed refusals, host-clock scan; raw-order binding mutant killed. just check: PASS. Deadline-driven cancellation (Budget deadline at Cx::checkpoint -> CancelKind::Deadline) exists but is not bound: see report."}	blake3:G7gGfyPZ29Dp3xl-xUoovnhnDtxKgNFvrcM5hvkoazk
1790142076103723	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy0hI		item.create	bn-36wy3	{"description":"bn-3m1d bound virtual time but not timeout-driven cancellation. A task spawned with a Budget deadline cancels itself at Cx::checkpoint once the lab clock passes the deadline (CancelKind::Deadline). No CancelRequest and no region cancel are traced. The region calculus has no single-task cancellation outside a cancelled region's drain, and CancelCause has no deadline value. Deliver: a calculus step for single-task (deadline) cancellation, with RFC text (semantic core: GOV §4 record plus a dedicated security review; coordinate with bn-2318t, which also adds a worker step), a  cause in the cancellation family, and binding support for finite Budget deadlines, using the same corpus, seed, differential and mutation shape. Then drop the narrowing in the START_HERE virtual time annotation.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:pr-14"],"title":"PR-14: bind budget-deadline cancellation (CancelKind::Deadline) — calculus single-task cancellation step and a deadline cause (bn-3m1d)"}	blake3:h9Pu9lEtM4pz4DvO7k6P2VtEuMzKofXpC7dwFPfbK9c
