1790142697855977	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy3xI		item.comment	bn-2ee4c	{"body":"ADR-0054: Ed25519 via ed25519-dalek =2.2.0 (defaults off, zeroize), in continuum-evidence only; zero new lock packages (already resolved via asupersync/nkeys, audited in bn-lf4i; addendum added). New continuum_evidence::signing: KeyEntropy capability, LocalKeyring mint-on-first-use, SigningRegistry standing+audit (mint/rotate/revoke/supersede), AllowedSigners, SignatureVerifier (typed Provenance; CI fail-closed AcceptanceChainInvalid). 20 new tests incl RFC 8032 KATs, pinned envelope, metamorphic, differential. TEST-9-07 enforced, docs/19 annotated; T04 signing control rebound live. just check: all gates pass except governance security-review-present (lead-owned; T09 review-gates fails from the same cause). Wire/daemon exposure is a follow-up."}	blake3:Zps_B1ny5NseEL6MyMFZAiT2smyWLNebGhCvorU6GuI
