1790175189904728	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEynBM		item.comment	bn-2318t	{"body":"cr-1ckhmw fix in 0e285e4 (on 021a299). One predicate, WorkerState::holds_substrate (Running or Suspended), decides open, discharge and transfer. Open needs an Open region. Discharge and transfer allow Open or Draining, not Finalized. The pr14_impl04 journal shape replays as a total teardown. New mutants added. Differential pins 67 states and 362 admitted transitions. RFC 0026 corr. 51 item 3 rewritten. Replied on th-3nzexr, no vote. just check: all pass except the lead-owned security-review-present."}	blake3:DW9TU6yDGi_rxqYqnH6VqaM9IH8JnvdUXkktlRi3WCY
1790175246575124	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEynRM		item.comment	bn-3a9sr	{"body":"cr-1sxoia fixes in 24c3f97: name-to-index tables with precharged lookups (no element scan), value text charged by bytes, identities shared via Arc. 4 new resource_bounds tests; anti-vacuity mutant (restored position) fails at 1.99x. just check green except governance security-review-present (lead-owned); dossier, lean, test-policy pass."}	blake3:5bTODtBVp-eOlectuAXDWlA6At5nso7K7_NekWGsA04
1790175777612839	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEynhM		item.comment	bn-1hape	{"body":"cr-3l3n47 fixes in 56eb35d: descriptor-bound keystore reads (lstat, O_NOFOLLOW, fstat dev/inode/owner/mode), dir and ancestor trust checks with typed refusals, no re-mint over existing stores; framed audit log replayed record-by-record via SigningRegistry::replay_record with count/size caps, hostile-log test under ulimit -v. just check: only T09 review-gates / security-review-present (lead-owned)."}	blake3:dYxdtVHpKuzaIXyrWR-MPe4l67IwOwbIjeuY05xibeM
1790176459181530	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEynxM		item.comment	bn-2318t	{"body":"cr-1ckhmw round 3 fixed in 06cbbea. transfer_substrate needs both parties acting (Running or Suspended, not in a Draining(Cancelled) region). Self-transfer is refused with SubstrateSelfTransfer. Only discharge keeps the cleanup exception. Differential: 2 workers, cancel, transfers; 668 states and 4,968 admitted transitions pinned; 5 mutants detected. RFC 0026 corr. 51 item 3 is updated. The A7 self-audit lists 6 divergences on th-2lt2pp; the open ones are no ack phase (stricter on transfer in the request-to-ack window) and no committed/aborted discharge distinction (more permissive after ack). just check: all pass except the lead-owned security-review-present."}	blake3:RaI7agLa5ndTGsuzUuR1HZsgKNjWUVgNs75AH0LM5RQ
1790176488670495	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyoBM		item.comment	bn-36wy3	{"body":"Also in scope (bn-2318t self-audit, divergences 2-3 against the A7 model). (2) A7 marks a task as cancelling from its own acknowledgement; the calculus treats the whole region as cancelling from Draining(Cancelled). So a transfer between the cancel request and the acknowledgement is admitted by A7 and refused by the calculus. (3) After acknowledgement A7 admits only an aborted discharge; the calculus admits any discharge. Add a per-task acknowledge notion, a discharge outcome (committed or aborted) on discharge_substrate, and single-task (deadline) cancellation, then re-run the continuumd region_staging_differential and the A7 agreement."}	blake3:XDLd8QzLyKKpBM5xjuQTiWB7X_VksKCbBxJfKw8lonM
1790176488714052	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyoRM		item.comment	bn-j1a50	{"body":"Also watch the bn-2318t divergences 2-3 (see bn-36wy3). Until bn-36wy3 lands, a real journal that transfers an obligation between a cancel request and the task's acknowledgement would lift as a violation under the shared ledger. Keep the A7 agreement sweep green."}	blake3:qLsg9t6sYS6fHprnCJi8vNek3NBDXn3UkRHOjdlo_sA
