1790184085269747	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuxM		item.create	bn-10j7z	{"description":"Part B of the bn-15zfa split (design: RFC 0003 correction 4, encoding (b), a flat bounded-integer layout). Deliver: one action per parameter tuple, named A(p=u,...), with the total count and widest name preflighted; quantifier expansion over a whole finite type, a static set, or a state-dependent set guarded by membership, as balanced and/or trees; and a plan pass that computes size, depth and nested fan-out before building, then precharges output and work and checks depth. Types: sorts, Bool, enumerations, and bounded Nat/Int from the run-config bounds of part A. Semantic core: GOV §4 record plus a dedicated security review. Do the common.md self-audit.","kind":"task","labels":["cml","phase-b","req:phase-b","req:pr-15a","req:phase-b-del-04"],"title":"Model value domain B: action-schema expansion and planned quantifier expansion over scalar finite types (RFC 0003 corr. 4; bn-15zfa)"}	blake3:LwoLUVfa4Z56WNPYy_6DL1k8bl6mR-Ea1oXzJAOZfNc
1790184085439939	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyvBM		item.create	bn-23hzh	{"description":"Part C of the bn-15zfa split. Deliver: the flat layouts for Option, Set and Map, with the absent-entry minimum rule added to init and whole-layout writes; static-key selection (cml.lower.dynamic_key and value_outside_bound refusals); missing-key reads as named A#defined / I#defined predicates giving a typed undefined-read outcome; and the replicated register lowering under Nat max 1 (14 slots, 50 actions), explored by the reference engine and checked by a differential against an independent hand-written Rust simulation of the register (reachable states and invariant verdicts). Fairness stays with bn-1ln12. Semantic core: GOV §4 record plus a dedicated security review. Do the common.md self-audit.","kind":"task","labels":["cml","phase-b","req:phase-b","req:pr-15a","req:phase-b-del-04"],"title":"Model value domain C: collection layouts, definedness, and the replicated-register differential (RFC 0003 corr. 4; bn-15zfa)"}	blake3:B8TwNBhTQwi0Ohq-N60p7z4g5zxJC54LjM_POv7cVxU
