1790215209633260	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy5hQ		item.comment	bn-3glnv	{"body":"cr-2unxyh round 4 fixed at 44536e4.\n(1) HIGH CWE-835. links_are_attested now runs links_form_chains. It checks degrees first, with no traversal: at most 1 successor and 1 predecessor per key, and no duplicate revocation. Then it checks for cycles with a visited set and a walk bounded by the edge count, so it cannot loop on a tail into a cycle. The adoption walk is also marked and bounded. Tests: tail into a 2-cycle and a 3-cycle, pure 2- and 3-cycles, shared successor, double rotation, replayed rotation and revocation, all in every permutation, each MalformedRequest with nothing changed; plus a unit test at the 4096-link bound. The sweep found no other unbounded walks in this bone.\n(2) MEDIUM. Install now requires RECOVERY_RECORDS=3 free while the key is active: 4092 and 4093 install, 4094–4096 are NoRoomToRecover, 4097 is RecordBound. Every installable length revokes, replaces, and revokes the replacement.\njust check: only the lead-owned security-review-present failure."}	blake3:MGFlhxCEWFBsxnxdQP_9VvUzQ5KWFwbqOhlwVBYOX70
