1790218829998541	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyjxU		item.create	bn-2ri63	{"description":"bn-2rsp established claim A (Nodes=3) with crashes uncounted, because a 0..2 crash counter triples the init domain past MAX_INIT_ENUMERATION (2^22). Add a lowering path that enumerates a fully pinned init state without the product domain, or raise the bound with a measured budget. This is a semantic-core change (GOV §4 and a security review). Then establish crashes ≤ 2 counted in the engine.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:pr-16"],"title":"PR-16 claim A with a counted atomic crash: an init fast path for fully pinned init states, or a higher MAX_INIT_ENUMERATION (bn-2rsp follow-up)"}	blake3:qTQcG_rnPGth9R_J9ZIllGBBFo3EsiOAe3F3b1szHL4
