1790223371806452	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuBU		item.comment	bn-131yp	{"body":"IMPL-03 delivered in WS bn-131yp at HEAD e08acf1f, not merged. The program is in crates/continuum-asupersync/tests/support/replicated_register.rs, with no new crate or edge. Writer: Transaction permit=Reserve, IoOp open=Submit, IoOp commit=Sync, explicit abort=Abort, region cancel=Lose, then a channel confirm. Coordinator Transaction commit after a majority=Ack. tests/pr16_impl03_replicated_register.rs has 21 tests over 5 plans: exhaustive 6,732 logs plus 4 seeded samples of 400. All journals are Conforms and A7-accepted. Every step is a durable step or a stutter, and every Ack is an enabled Choose. Identical logs give identical bytes and the seed is invariant. The IMPL-02 slot protocol is ported verbatim with a drift check, and it reproduces the IMPL-02 golden counts. The golden has 13 IDs pr16-impl03-*. An adversarial pass found no blocker, and the should-fix items are fixed. just check: exit 0."}	blake3:QO-qzjsN_6TGnUOtvaamXfZwVIcKYBGzCiNetRhV7Ko
