1790227965427515	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy3RU		item.create	bn-2faf1	{"description":"bn-28oa: M03 (stale-epoch) and M08 (stale-timer) are excluded by the substrate, because commands to a prior incarnation's tasks are typed TaskEnded, and a crash cancels timers. The remaining gap is a stale epoch or timer identity carried INSIDE message or timer data, which the register program cannot express today: it has no data-carrying messages and no timer callbacks. Extend the program (support module) with epoch-tagged messages and timer payloads, and run M03 and M08 against that carrier, detected or typed-refused with a stated expectation.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:pr-16"],"title":"PR-16 mutants M03/M08: stale epoch or timer carried in message or timer data (register program has no data-carrying messages or timer callbacks) (bn-28oa follow-up)"}	blake3:lQ5Ahc3cXjDZRZ0QvOOUy_8Vkr-qW4nn7B0dLq1gapg
