1790229457101544	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy8hU		item.comment	bn-2zccj	{"body":"Delivered at ca7b6bf6. g2_injection_corpus_evidence.rs: new Carriage classification decided per case (Field 27, Handle 3, StoredEvidence 5, StoredContinuation 2, Unlanded 11); the runner panics on an uncarriable payload and no longer substitutes a handle (guessed handles must parse). The task.resume cases now resume real stored continuations: stale-snapshot-substitution/isolation-escape a forged continuation (parked via TaskTable::park) pinning a superseded snapshot and the payload's epoch -> StaleSnapshot; isolation/hard-kill the continuation of a really cancelled task -> Ok{Cancelled}, state unchanged. Five evidence.verify prose cases (also vacuous: they fell back to an unheld ev_ handle) now verify stored certificate-class nodes holding the payload -> EpochUnsupported, status unchanged. Fixture provisions a second accepted contract, workspace create/fork/seal, two parked verification runs and a cancel; corpus_admissions slices provisioning off the ledger. Leg 6 adds 9 tests: typed refusal + unchanged state per carrier, each-tamper-alone and untampered-resume controls, a real-CONTCERT kernel positive control, census pin, 3 should_panic fail-loud tests. gate_g2_07: no pinned count changed (28/9/37 are body facts); F4 and method-4 prose corrected (stale 34/25 -> 37/28). Prose in plan 24.5, research/35, docs/18: no overstatement found, unchanged. Adversarial opus pass: 3 MEDIUM + 3 LOW addressed; M6/M7 kernel-bypass mutants now caught. just check: exit 0."}	blake3:bVJblkb42pG3__aF6WOXvaVAOMm-kxs1FARJhEKN6bY
1790229494251557	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy8xU		item.create	bn-2lc0t	{"description":"From bn-2zccj's carrier audit. (1) evidence.link refuses agent: actors before it reads the body, and the fixture's evidence.link subject and context.expand context name nothing the daemon holds, so those payloads are carried but not read. Give them held subjects and contexts. (2) isolation/resource-limits: verification.start is refused MalformedRequest because the envelope names no snapshot, so its declared carrier (the budget) is never exercised. Also, a budget with every dimension absent reads as unbounded; check that is intended. (3) observe.ingest is denied at admission for both principals; decide whether one should hold the data grant. (4) task.resume does not re-derive a continuation's content identity (LOW-4). (5) Prose: PHASE_A_EXIT_PACKAGE.md §5.1 says every case is driven through the real wire boundary, but 7 were not carried. Add a correction note to that historical record, not a rewrite. The injection.rs module doc says 'refusing all', but some cases are answered Ok and inert.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","security","risk:high"],"title":"research/35 corpus: carriers that are present but never read, and overstated prose (bn-2zccj follow-ups)"}	blake3:uPy3hxzuLR9hl0WV_9btpUv8kUWWJGcWzi1CDTNO9cw
