1790230059162379	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy-BU		item.comment	bn-342ek	{"body":"Amended at e79f7e2e after an adversarial opus review (verdict SHIP). Fixed its one finding: sharing require_admitted_locally between the signed and unsigned accept paths also moved the signed path's own clockless case from AcceptanceChainInvalid to UnsupportedSemanticFeature (the more honest code, matching intent.lock). RFC 0037 correction 23 and the IDL rule intent.bundles prose now state this explicitly. just check: fmt-check, lint, test, boundaries, covenant, governance all pass. dossier fails only on PLAN_BONE_TRACEABILITY.md staleness (lead-owned per common.md exception, unrelated to this change -- verified as the sole dossier finding via a direct validate_dossier.py run). lean and test-policy passed clean in an earlier full run at 2166e0d before an intervening maw rebase; nothing after that touched Lean or test-policy files. HEAD is e79f7e2e9e8f06055bf10ea0ecedaecc69b9b7bb."}	blake3:XgsS8vXb664Tz3RBxsIJ4GK9D_yfd0mUbWsXyJvTJoE
