1790230926444803	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy_RU		item.comment	bn-2zccj	{"body":"cr-2rgnsb addressed at 78da2e17. gate_g2_07: the promotion-gate clause table is now derived from a run of the whole corpus at every rung (Clause/Basis; 6 observed, 3 fixed-unobservable: real-worker isolation, epoch binding, re-lock). 'every case is refused' is now false (10 cases answer ok at some rung here: 6 evidence.verify, 3 observe.ingest, 1 evidence.query; hard-kill answers ok in the delivering suite), 'refused by a trusted authority check' false, audit-log false. Totals 4/5 -> 3 held/6 open. New regression the_refusal_clause_cannot_hold_while_any_case_answers_ok. 45->48 wording fixed; scope doc rewritten. injection.rs module doc no longer says the suite holds the daemon to refusing all cases and states the gate is open on its refusal clause. research/35 and plan 24.5: no non-quote prose claims every case is refused; ratified quote unchanged. Hard-kill carrier still asserts Ok. just check: exit 0."}	blake3:vJTpoWxnLcN2TuoRvQ5A70anx38hklGHsxPAoXOmBL4
1790231258624866	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy_hU		item.comment	bn-18w74	{"body":"cr-33e464 fixed at 2154664c. HIGH: CustodyWrite splits a custody write at the rename. NotRecorded rolls back and answers PublicationAborted. Unconfirmed (after the rename or at the dir sync) keeps the change, answers success (the IDL has no outcome-unknown shape), and counts it with custody_unconfirmed/unconfirmed_writes. The erased custody keeps the phase. KeystoreFaults seam at BeforeRename/AfterRename/DirectorySync. Test: wire, live and relaunched authority agree for mint/rotate/revoke/adopt at every phase. MEDIUM: validate_custody requires the revocation link of each own key revoked as compromised, no active own key but the held one, and an own successor for each lost own key. Restart test removes only the link and expects OwnLink. just check: only the lead-owned security-review-present (T09 review gates) fails; dossier, lean, test-policy pass."}	blake3:A_JbQXFMpFv4--KaCGjMJUa7-AgkssqrcgG3bj6oTIo
1790231371725714	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy_xU		item.move	bn-342ek	{"state":"done"}	blake3:FQ9qpgsQQIm-59U--4PIjwlZ8DEDSuMRYPgLzdhGzOA
1790232216987933	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEygBY		item.comment	bn-20d8u	{"body":"Path (b): PR-16 crash claims restated as graceful region cancellation. Fail-stop is open, owned by bn-20d8u. Reason: the binding has no op that stops a task without its cleanup, so path (a) needs a src and journal change (design in the lead report). CRASH_SEMANTICS header line in the IMPL-03/04/05 goldens, and a per-mutant crash: line in IMPL-05. Golden changes are additions only, and the identities are unchanged. New tests: IMPL-03 crash-is-Cancel tripwire; M02, whose 24 detecting runs of 4 plans are runs only because a later crash's cleanup aborts the lost permit (all 1,086 other runs are ReservationDropped); M07, whose witness still acks with no durable majority when the lost bytes stay volatile, and not when they are durable. START_HERE PR 16 is restated. The opus pre-review found 0 blockers and 6 should-fix items, all fixed. just check exit 0. The first run failed on a transient cargo fingerprint write error, and the rerun passed."}	blake3:Qo0XrjgdWjlu0t3_iwwvxq9__1TQWWjdfdD7Sbd4RcY
1790232456175329	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEygRY		item.comment	bn-2zccj	{"body":"cr-2rgnsb round 2 addressed at a2c3154e. (1) Decision now carries AdmissionRecord.denial; 'refused by a trusted authority check' requires an error AND a denial category (Admission, DerivedHandle, ReplayAuthority). Controls: Some(false)+Error+Admission yes, Some(true)+Error+None no, DerivedHandle yes, ReplayAuthority yes, Some(true)+Ok no, codec-refused no; plus a live check that the real run has admitted-then-refused attempts. (2) Status clauses now read a test-side status view (every intent status, every evidence handle+status) around each case at each rung; the wire view (evidence.query = handles only) was blind. Finding: at every rung, read included, comments-weakening-property/evidence-status (evidence.verify, authority read, @mutation) moves the seeded observation node Proposed(BOTTOM)->Observed; benign twin identical, payload not carried, write authored by the daemon verification service after re-derivation. Evidence-status clause now false: 2 held / 7 open. Old wire test renamed the_corpus_moves_no_intent_status_and_the_wire_view_cannot_see_evidence_status and pins the blindness; verdict row now REFUTED. Delivering suite's fixture has no verifiable observation node, so its zero-evidence-status test is bounded; noted in its doc and in injection.rs doc. just check exit 0."}	blake3:aLqMYbnwkBus3PHkLReJJMur5uXqg7qzGPNDGsQpbQ4
1790232758924032	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyghY		item.comment	bn-2ri63	{"body":"Done in 4ae766d9. New opt-in InitPath::Pinned (RFC 0003 corr. 6) enumerates the product of pinned axes, not the whole domain. It is exact against the whole-domain oracle and charged before work, under the same MAX_INIT_ENUMERATION. Claim A with <=2 counted atomic crashes, Nodes=3: pinned lowering under default limits, 184,512 states. The engine establishes all 3 invariants, and the states equal the literal atomic-crash closure. New evidence pr16-impl02-pos-04/05, neg-07, bnd-06 in tests/golden/pr16_impl02_counted_crash.evidence.txt. The bn-2rsp golden is unchanged. Tests: init_pinned.rs (10) plus 6 in pr16_impl02. Adversarial pass: 1 MEDIUM (repeated slot names) fixed, LOWs documented. just check: fails only on lead-owned security-review-present. dossier, lean, and test-policy pass separately. No C018 rerun: model-core and engine-reference are unchanged."}	blake3:gXasbf-3OFSKsfM4ZQFTHgSZX0oaVtY7AtBho-NiQx4
1790233081637482	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEygxY		item.comment	bn-2fk3	{"body":"continuum-effects-storage: storage/append-log-v0 0.1.0 profile (17 rows: 11 modelled; 6 unsupported, 3 of them with Unsupported steps) and Lab handler. Submit is volatile. Sync is a per-node barrier ticket. Persist makes the covered prefix stable. Ack is delivered only after Persist and only to its live incarnation, else Fenced. A crash keeps stable records and a chosen prefix of the volatile suffix, and may tear the first lost record. Truncate drops a torn tail. A write over a torn tail is a ProgramFault (M07). The COMPOSITION table states the lockstep with process/crash-restart-v0: same step boundary, both packs must accept, same (node, epoch) fence. no_std compiler lane. INV-015 moves storage out of the scaffold sweep to a 4-leg audit plus leg mutants. 25 tests: exhaustive differential vs an independent model (53,224 states, 21 mutants caught, among them ack-before-sync, lose-synced, kept-not-stable, 3 torn-tail variants), 2,100-log determinism, replay, prefix replay, crash windows (6,164 windows, 2,262 runs, 375 fenced, 2,660 acked ranges durable), M01 golden, pinned hex and fingerprint, honesty vs RFC 0002, docs/17 §6/§9/§10, scenario, contract, manifest and process profile. Fresh opus pre-review: 8 findings, all fixed. just check exit 1: governance stops at T09 'review gates' on the lead-owned GOV-4-15 independence-review-present finding. Every later step passes when run separately. Commit 829342e2."}	blake3:OlQYtvMXVkqOwPi89OglSk5RfGflPXCNRDuhAH5wLFI
1790268787598505	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyhBY		item.comment	bn-18w74	{"body":"User decision 2026-09-24: add ErrorCode OutcomeUnknown in protocol 3.9 (IDL 1.17) for unconfirmed custody writes, with the authority quarantined and reconciled on restart. Codex cr-33e464 round 2 blocked on answering success."}	blake3:8mvW51V4qCOD5sBmut-uvj2w9t6CRAACFPMsQ1HFf2A
