1790268894507476	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyihY		item.comment	bn-20d8u	{"body":"Path (b) merged: every PR-16 crash claim now states graceful region cancellation, the goldens gained additions only, and tripwire tests were added. This bone stays OPEN for path (a), fail-stop in the binding. Design from the worker: SubstrateOp::Crash{region}; tasks stop without checkpoint or cancel; obligations stay open; RegionCrashed and Fenced journal events (a journal family and encoding change, with the lift and the A7 model); projection Lose from the crash; Quiescence and Conservation count fenced items separately. Blocker: asupersync 0.5.0 root close waits for child regions, so the shutdown needs a quiescence exception or a substrate feature. Then rerun M02/M03/M07/M08 under fail-stop. This is a src change in continuum-asupersync and needs a GOV record."}	blake3:1_UOzFyiCm1GSPb-EDQbilvRiUsNPKm_M1qUyYz-I7Q
