1790275145022324	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyqRY		item.create	bn-fxxf2	{"description":"bn-20d8u path (a): lift_crash turns stopped workers into Fail(crashed); a parked worker first gets a lift-internal Resume, stated as an approximation in RFC 0026 c58. Add a calculus WorkerStep::Crash, a differential against continuumd, and remove the approximation.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:pr-16"],"title":"PR-16 calculus crash step: WorkerStep::Crash with a continuumd differential, replacing the lift's internal Resume approximation (bn-20d8u follow-up)"}	blake3:OA_-QpUlBEtkftvyTh83omd8T6wa0bVjqRdKxhpBK6I
