1790276522054739	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuRY		item.comment	bn-31vf	{"body":"PR-22A/IMPL-02 spike in crates/continuum-incremental (commits e12dfeec, adf430c2): custom content-addressed engine over parse/elaborate/build_model/projections/explore/domain_safety/check_invariant; four reuse-edge classes (Exact content-identity, Conservative side input with recorded assumptions A1/A2, Validated finite-closure cert checked by continuum-certificate, Experimental textual heuristic, interactive lane only); triple quarantine; explain_invalidation with typed edge chains; independent clean-recompute parity audit (INV-010). Retained artifact pr22a-impl02-reuse-spike (tests/golden/pr22a_impl02_reuse_spike.json), 17-edit DieHard corpus x 2 lanes + traces: promotion lane 0 parity mismatches, 0 under-invalidation; reuses Exact 53 / Validated 3 / Conservative 14; explored states 66 vs 226 clean. Interactive: Experimental 6 reuses, 6 mismatches, all caught and quarantined (Experimental, parse, 1). 34 crate tests. Daemon wire untouched (needs RFC 0031 diff artifact). Adversarial opus pass done, findings fixed. just check: all green except governance security-review-present on tools/governance/reviews/bn-31vf.toml (lead-owned); dossier, lean, test-policy pass. C018 evidence regenerated."}	blake3:BabJ6-wtvPgapyh6FG5TRQ3cJOgFdxIlcBcnRWj7BvI
