1790276758251719	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuxY		item.create	bn-ympz5	{"description":"Kernel review of bn-35y4f (low): receipt.rs:95 writes checker.version +wire.CONTCERT.2 and wire_epoch_id CONTCERT/2 for every receipt, including epoch-1 certificates. The claim is still not mislabelled as model-bound (trusted_components keep certificate-model-correspondence), but the receipt should carry CheckedClaim::wire_epoch. Also (info, th-30q8yb): model.rs:327 maps evaluator depth exhaustion to Rejected(EvaluationOverflow); make it typed Unsupported(ExpressionDepth) so a future decoder/evaluator depth mismatch cannot false-reject.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:c018"],"title":"Kernel receipt reports the certificate's own wire epoch, not CONTCERT/2 for every certificate (cr-18l29w th-1qyxxb)"}	blake3:dwg19h9pXwksFRjy5qgYOmD9C5KAY4n1aTFyRCjWUo8
