1790277943523391	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy0BY		item.comment	bn-2faf1	{"body":"Carrier in ws bn-2faf1 at 0c49ed0e. This change is test-support only; the binding, IDL and journal are unchanged. build_carried: each incarnation gets a process epoch. At a replica's last crash with a submit in flight, a message (the late completion) or a supervisor timer payload carries the epoch, slot and value to the new incarnation. The Recovery boundary carries a current-epoch report. The receiver confirms only when the epoch is its own. Carrier baselines, 3 carriers x 2 crash modes: 0 findings. 1504 stale payloads received, 0 confirmed. 546 recovery reports confirmed. Counts come from the journals. M03 (reused epoch) on the message carrier: detected, RuntimeToAbstract/AckedNotDurable plus Agreement, 953 runs of 120 plans. M08 (unchecked timer) on the timer carrier: 972 runs of 120 plans. Both hold under graceful and fail-stop, with 0 refusals. The expectations were written before the first run and were not changed. Of the 36 changed plans with no finding, 21 have no quorum, and 256 more logs detect the other 15. Existing golden identities are unchanged. mutants test: 30 tests. The opus pre-review found 0 blockers and 5 should-fix items, all fixed. just check exit 0."}	blake3:rqNstBLjNC8fU9cGdZOdxns87mI5GlzEhMU3jG5wknY
