1790280261291924	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy2hY		item.comment	bn-31vf	{"body":"cr-1jv75r fixes (4687d7d0, f155a66f, 1614d9a6): cache entries carry producing class + licence-triple provenance (no refresh, no Validated store; quarantine evicts by provenance; promotion refuses Experimental-origin entries; triple = edge licence); domain_safety keyed on explore; I#defined and A#defined are typed Undefined/UndefinedAction outcomes, implemented independently in engine and audit; exploration encoding commits to every successor row (explore/2); check_witness binds every envelope field + property class; Validated records assumption V1 for its engine-side definedness scan; domain_safety/check_invariant function_version 2. Regression tests fail on e6402ab8 (3 behavioural checked in a scratch worktree). Two further adversarial opus passes, findings fixed. Golden: lane totals unchanged; traces Validated 4->3, Conservative 10->11. just check: all gates pass except governance security-review-present (lead-owned); dossier/lean/test-policy pass."}	blake3:PSP6Abbus0sC0rlT5D_nUrv9ID__9CevvMXcGmdzY1k
1790280315011348	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy2xY		item.create	bn-24a5c	{"description":"bn-31vf / Codex cr-1jv75r th-34rprx: partial-map definedness is ignored by invariant checking. The incremental engine and its audit now return typed Undefined / UndefinedAction, but engine-reference's own checker (the differential oracle and a C018 producer) still evaluates an invariant or action without checking its definedness predicate, so a partial-map read can be silently treated as a value. Make engine-reference report a typed outcome for undefined reads (INV-008), align model-core semantics, and add a differential over models with partial maps. Touches a C018 producer: rerun tcb evidence.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","invariant","risk:high"],"title":"continuum-engine-reference checker ignores definedness predicates (I#defined, A#defined) (bn-31vf finding)"}	blake3:YvFBYwioUVc606At7MQrn6lvspRLCUWbxc6iGxFKZmU
