1790282331285654	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy9BY		item.comment	bn-1oj6	{"body":"IMPL-04 done in afd1da18 (ws bn-1oj6). Each pack profile now carries UNSUPPORTED, one typed case per unsupported row (host behaviour, Request: step or step-in-state or no operation, Reliance: assumed or subsumed or owner or outside-pack), in its canonical bytes. network, process, storage go to 0.2.0 with 7 new assumptions. The time pack declares time/unmodelled-v0 0.1.0 (7 RFC 0002 clock rows, no operation, no_std lane, INV-015 audit). Tests: pr15_impl04_* per pack (hon/pos/bnd), with the step bound as the one declared exception. Fingerprints and journal pins are re-pinned. Record: tools/governance/reviews/bn-1oj6.toml, with [pack.independence_review] left out. just check: every step passes except governance, where check_obligations and T09 review-gates fail only on the missing independence review (lead-owned). dossier, lean and test-policy were run on their own and pass."}	blake3:IDNrcyf7XgonGvyBwpYRTXL8aghYdyDlzLgmGMQd6JQ
1790282369639396	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy9RY		item.create	bn-1eld5	{"description":"bn-1oj6 bumped network/process/storage profiles 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0 and added declared assumptions (connectionless-send, atomic-payload, power-loss-as-crashes, node-level-lifecycle, no-medium-corruption, no-device-profile, durable-log-entry). crates/continuum-intent/tests/fixtures/replicated-register-contract.json trusts these profiles by name with no version pin, so new assumptions reach its verdicts with no intent revision. Strengthening an assumption is a privileged intent revision (INV-001/INV-011). Pin profile version+fingerprint in intent contracts (schema-governed), refuse or require revision on drift, and surface pack assumptions in the semantic diff.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","invariant","risk:high"],"title":"Intent contracts pin pack profile versions; a pack assumption change reaches a verdict only through an intent revision (INV-011, bn-1oj6 finding)"}	blake3:cbsyWo-ZfQ8UkMjVe-dE-5RdZa62ZNTgzkw7AiWYtvw
