1790284305733249	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEygRc		item.create	bn-11qmr	{"description":"bn-voq4 delivered C005 with a stateful persistent/sleep-set reduction (RFC 0004 correction 1), not the literal source-DPOR RFC 0004 names. Its sleep-set donation rule over SCCs is argued in src/checker.rs, not machine-checked. Deliver source-DPOR (vector clocks, stateless replay, backtrack sets), differential against the stateful baseline and the unreduced oracle, and either prove or independently cross-check the donation rule. Also the M10 independence mutant of replicated_register.md belongs to DPOR.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:c005"],"title":"Source-DPOR with vector clocks and stateless replay, as RFC 0004 names it, differential against the C005 stateful baseline (bn-voq4 follow-up)"}	blake3:GcNZVrsc2gkBeZw-dQZ89OTiGtd7Xy4mLX476TLk6E0
