1790286981061378	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEypRc		item.comment	bn-voq4	{"body":"cr-1wuzry fix 4c281661: checker precharges all model/witness-proportional work (labels, names, assignments, stubborn/sleep/edge lists, ordered searches), out-of-range edge label Dangling under any budget, reducer proviso/root pay first; boundary tests (200k-outcome fanout, exact-boundary sweep to 20k, million-entry witness lists). Adversarial pass findings fixed. just check: only lead-owned GOV-4-06 + traceability staleness fail."}	blake3:Avl0z4Zlq-3zUlM02fuFg198MnVmL3ni1vMEJugGn9U
1790287020084826	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyphc		item.comment	bn-18w74	{"body":"cr-2qu5zr (HIGH) fixed at 343f9921 without *at calls, unsafe or new crates. The store path is walked component by component, following symlinks by hand, StrictModes style: every directory and symlink passed through must be owned by root or the owner, and a directory not group/world-writable unless sticky. The whole check is re-run before each lock, open, write, rename and removal, and the directory must keep its first device/inode (StoreMoved). The adversarial pass found no blockers. Fixed: an incomplete walk (missing ancestor) is re-walked before anything beneath it is trusted; new end-to-end /tmp-link and ForeignOwner tests (the first two symlink tests alone passed on the old code). Conclusion: sufficient for other non-root users; *at binding (cap-std or rustix) would also close owner/root-only windows, if ever wanted. just check run recipe by recipe in the foreground: only the lead-owned security-review-present (T09 review gates) fails."}	blake3:4V6AZaNfa_IG3Tw3qa4m0t4_b5XkZf6rBBhmIbMxe0I
1790287120560075	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEypxc		item.comment	bn-1id0n	{"body":"Decision: END. An unsupported crash ends judgement at its event. RFC 0026 correction 60 bounds correction 57 to whole-journal checks, which read one fixed state. Later events depend on the unmodelled crash effect: fences owed, a shared channel, the global clock, and ancestor settles. At the crash event, every effect-independent check runs first. The cancellation case is not reached (InterruptedOwnCancel or CrashedRegionState come first). The lift is unchanged, and only doc comments changed. The A7 model gains Verdict::Unsupported{at,task}. fail_stop_crash tests: an_unsupported_crash_ends_judgement_at_its_event covers (a) to (d) and controls. an_unsupported_crash_in_a_real_journal_ends_judgement_in_both covers 976 spliced journals and 5,939 variants, with 2,378 unsupported and 0 disagreements. Typed agreement was added to deletions_and_swaps. Campaign identities and goldens are unchanged. No GOV record: the crate is boundary. Opus pre-review: 0 blockers, 2 should-fix, 5 nits, all fixed. just check exit 0. Commit ace44c34. Correction 60 collides with the bn-18w74 workspace's 60, so renumber whichever merges second."}	blake3:256SiyTuCg96QOyW4YGWXK3w3CKjhxXQZliXOyzqeo0
1790287190289270	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyqBc		item.comment	bn-1id0n	{"body":"Review anchor: 01M3APX65FX71404FV82FPQBYH for cr-uzmkb2 (security review, head 541256b9a80e)"}	blake3:ABTef_fhOjaXnA4WwmsP2uwWyV6yLKMaDGybwBmMIMM
