1790287995242882	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyqhc		item.comment	bn-1oj6	{"body":"cr-37bshu HIGH, ruling c1, done in d6577406 and ca6b5971. Each pack keeps -v0 frozen at 0.1.0 byte for byte (the registry test asserts the pre-bn-1oj6 fingerprints) and adds -v1 at 1.0.0 with the IMPL-04 content, on one Lab handler that journals -v1. The registry test pr15-impl04-hon-03 pins every (name, fingerprint) pair and counts declared profiles. The library-path revision is in continuum-semantic-diff/tests/pr15_impl04_profile_revision.rs (rev-01..06): adding -v1 gives faults added records with verdict allow (RFC 0037, cited); trusting -v1 too gives trust_boundaries unknown and review; a swap is removed plus added and blocks; -v9 is refused by W8. RFC 0002 correction 1 and a docs/12 §4 paragraph are added. just check: only [pack.independence_review] fails. Follow-up for the lead to file: RFC 0031 classifies an added profile by membership only, so a profile with superset assumptions is allow on the agent path."}	blake3:c8u6jEK9-lDWG66Rc_tr0yOROJC2u0FDVDPwbrTQAis
1790288036180042	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyqxc		item.create	bn-2llq9	{"description":"bn-1oj6 rev-02: RFC 0031 classifies fault_model.profiles by set membership, so adding network/adversarial-v1 (a superset of -v0's assumptions) is faults[..]:added, and RFC 0037's no-removal verb table allows added on both HumanAccept and AgentAccept. Adding assumptions is an assumption strengthening, a privileged intent revision (INV-001/INV-011). The classifier needs to see the profile's assumption set (via the pack registry) and classify a strengthening accordingly. Likely an RFC 0031/0037 normative change: if it changes a ratified gate or the verb table's authority, it needs the user.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","invariant","risk:high"],"title":"Semantic diff: an added domain-pack profile whose assumption set strengthens the fault model is classified allow on the agent path (INV-011 gap, bn-1oj6 finding)"}	blake3:EnC69Ke1GjfalBrL3_IsA-14qifTEY-VX9_giqGzHVM
