1790291809389603	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywBc		item.comment	bn-3gf6	{"body":"PR-22A/IMPL-03 baseline (ef1a2a08): tests/precision_baseline.rs, golden pr22a-impl03-precision-baseline. Precision and recall of invalidation against the independent clean recompute, per lane and per licence class, edits and trace modes, over Die Hard (17 edits) and a finite durable-register concretization (15 edits, tests/fixtures/durable_register_finite.ctm), against module granularity. Combined promotion: precision 62/94 (659 per mille) vs 64/185 (345) module, recall 62/62, FN 0; correct reuses Exact 53, Validated 6, Conservative 32; FP 32 = 29 key misses + 3 refused witnesses. Parity asserted per revision; recompute_wrong and phantom artifacts counted apart. Engine src unchanged. Finding: the engine takes no RunConfig, so the example register models fail build_model (cml.lower.non_integer_state). Adversarial opus review: 14 findings, majors fixed. just check: exit 0."}	blake3:L7DU6qp_6Jkn8cQCwFsAk7jI_l9x3CWEXx0C9CpJyQE
