1790292387398686	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyzxc		item.comment	bn-34mw	{"body":"cr-2r0m24 fix committed 06eb4fe3. th-3oo3iz: one-sided EngineError per field -> EngineFailure disagreement (defect_*, ddmin, quarantine); both sides same typed EngineError -> undecided (documented blind spot, pinned counts); adapter evaluate under catch_unwind -> EnginePanicked, always a defect, reported/minimized as the panic; identity/fields read once at Harness::new under guard. th-3q4asg: Engine declares Fields (no default), Lane requires Fields per side (mismatch refused), required invariants = model predicates; empty answer under ALL is InvariantCoverage; no-invariant fixtures and unjudged verdicts counted in pinned summary. New tests: one-sided error, same error both sides, panic (subject and projection-only oracle), no verdicts, no-invariant fixture, contracts read once, Holds beside errored exploration. Opus adversarial pass on delta: 7 findings, all fixed. just check: pass except lead-owned GOV-4-06 security-review-present (and T09 review-gates citing it; probe confirmed)."}	blake3:jXFNfhxQR3kHseMXZPhdR9-MXTFGUpnZuKb3iPD5Kec
