1790312787519087	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyvRg		item.comment	bn-4ykgg	{"body":"cr-2r6hol fixes committed (fix commit 1a8d1b94 plus sync resolutions; HEAD 2ea804b1). HIGH: receipt_coverage() refuses anything but Verdict::Complete. Complete requires a non-empty selection, every selected strategy run, at least one executed neighbor, and every valid neighbor executed and decided. Otherwise the verdict is Inconclusive(Unsupported), the run's own reason, or EngineError. The register's full campaign is now Inconclusive(Unsupported): dup/loss are unsupported and 2 strategies are not run. The supported 5-strategy profile is Complete and projects. MEDIUM: exhaustion returns Exploration::Suspended, a Pending record plus a serialized Continuation. resume/resume_bytes re-run no committed neighbor and reproduce the uninterrupted result_bytes. The continuation is bound to core, subject, envelope and config, and counts must match dispositions. New tests: an_exhausted_budget_suspends_and_resumes_exactly (every run boundary plus a work sweep), chained_resumes_advance_monotonically_to_the_same_result, a_foreign_or_forged_continuation_is_refused, coverage_gaps_are_never_projected_as_complete, and register an_exhausted_budget_suspends_and_resumes_to_the_same_result. just check: all green except the lead-owned GOV-4-06 security-review-present (check_obligations and t09 review gates)."}	blake3:Y4zIevPqedeQwnrAAlmq5afb46DmkHH1BpMXRmhxp9o
